msgstr "使用基本身份验证，并通过您自定义的 `io.quarkus.vertx.http.runtime.security.HttpSecurityPolicy` 来授权请求，例如来自 <<custom-http-security-policy>> 的 `CustomNamedHttpSecPolicy` Bean。作为 CDI Bean 且未命名的策略也属于全局策略。 若要仅将策略应用于此路径，请像 `CustomNamedHttpSecPolicy` 那样为 Bean 指定名称，或者不要将该类声明为 CDI Bean，而是传入使用 `new` 创建的实例。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use the Bearer token authentication and authorize the `SecurityIdentity` with your own policy.\n"
"Bearer token authentication requires the `quarkus-oidc`, `quarkus-smallrye-jwt`, or `quarkus-elytron-security-oauth2` extension."
msgstr "使用 Bearer 令牌身份验证，并根据您自己的策略对 `SecurityIdentity` 进行授权。Bearer 令牌身份验证需要 `quarkus-oidc` 、 `quarkus-smallrye-jwt` 或 `quarkus-elytron-security-oauth2` 扩展。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use Authorization Code Flow mechanism, which requires the `quarkus-oidc` extension, and write your own policy based on incoming request headers.\n"
"A policy with this signature also runs for anonymous requests, so it checks for them first."
msgstr "使用授权码流（Authorization Code Flow）机制（该机制需要 `quarkus-oidc` 扩展），并根据传入的请求头编写自己的策略。具有此签名的策略也会对匿名请求生效，因此它会首先检查这些请求。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "When Quarkus fires the `HttpSecurity` CDI event, the runtime configuration is ready, so you can inject configuration properties."
msgstr "当 Quarkus 触发 `HttpSecurity` CDI 事件时，运行时配置已就绪，因此您可以注入配置属性。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Require that all the requests to the `/user-info` path have string permissions `openid`, `email` and `profile`.\n"
"The same authorization can be required with the `@PermissionsAllowed(value = { \"openid\", \"email\", \"profile\" }, inclusive = true)` annotation instance placed on an endpoint."
msgstr "要求所有发往 `/user-info` 路径的请求都必须包含 `openid` 、 `email` 和 `profile` 这三个字符串权限。也可以通过在端点上添加 `@PermissionsAllowed(value = { \"openid\", \"email\", \"profile\" }, inclusive = true)` 注解实例来实现相同的授权要求。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When permissions from the `application.properties` file and from the `HttpSecurity` event match the same request, the <<path-matching-rules,path-matching rules>> decide between them: the more specific permission wins, whether it has the longer path or lists the request method.\n"
"Both permissions apply only when they are equally specific, as described in <<matching-multiple-paths-and-methods-both-win>>, or when one of them is a <<shared-permission-checks,shared permission>>.\n"
"Programmatic setup for the management interface is not supported."
msgstr "当 `application.properties` 文件中的权限与 `HttpSecurity` 事件中的权限匹配同一请求时，由 xref:path-matching-rules[路径匹配规则] 来决定优先级：更具体的权限优先，无论其路径更长还是列出了请求方法。如 <<matching-multiple-paths-and-methods-both-win>> 所述，这两项权限仅在具体程度相同时才均适用，或者其中一项是 xref:shared-permission-checks[共享权限] 时才均适用。 不支持通过编程方式配置管理接口。"

